“Quote the Smith job. Two downlights, a new power point, and they want it done by Friday.”

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.540
LazyTradie builds it the way you would.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.260
Your prices.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:42.430
Your terms.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:43.490
Your name on it.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.680
So every customer gets the pro treatment.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.000
It works with the tools you already use.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.780
Less admin, more time on the tools.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.000
With LazyTradie.
